		  <style></style><div style="opacity:0" class="sc-faUpoM cFOwMS __pf __pf_NaApXXtk" id="__pf"><div data-pf-type="Body" class="sc-ksHpcM hkPZIR pf-1_"><div data-pf-type="Layout" class="sc-cVAmsi cFAsxI pf-2_"><div data-section-id="pf-bcc1" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-igXgud lhtyiH pf-3_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-cjrPHo eOcrMz"><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-4_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-5_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-6_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-8_">Privacy Policy</span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-9_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-10_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-11_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-13_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Introduction</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-14_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-16_">This website is owned and operated by Hodges Badge company, Inc. This Privacy Policy describes the ways we may <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">collect, use and share ("process") any information for individuals who visit this website (</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="https://www.hodgesbadge.com" target="_blank">www.hodgesbadge.com</a></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">). </span>This Privacy Policy is effective October 28, 2020</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-17_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-19_">Hodges Badge company, Inc. may be contacted by email at <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="mailto:info@hodgesbadge.com?subject=ATTN:%20Privacy%20Request">info@hodgesbadge.com</a>&nbsp;</span>or by mail at:<br>Attention: Privacy Request<br>Hodges Badge Company, Inc.<br>1170 East Main Road, Suite#1<br>Portsmouth, RI 02871</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-20_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-22_">If you are a California resident, additional rights you may have are described in detail on the <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="/pages/california-privacy-rights" target="_self">California Privacy Rights</a></span> page.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-23_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-24_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-25_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-27_"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Information We Collect</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-28_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-30_">To help us personalize and improve your Hodges Badge experience, we collect certain information when you connect with us, including:</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0px;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-gHjyzD dQAIat pf-31_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-32_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-34_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Information you submit.</span> We may collect information submitted in connection with creating a Customer Account, placing an online/catalog order, making a purchase/return, including your name, unique personal identifier, online identifier, mailing address, email address, postal address, telephone/mobile number, and payment Information. (NOTE: Credit card information is transmitted to our payment processor in an encrypted format using industry standard SSL (secure socket layer) encryption. Credit card numbers are not stored on the website.)</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-35_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-37_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Information you post on our website or social media.</span> We may collect Information you post or share in a public space on our site, including reviews and ratings, or by participating in a contest, sweepstakes, promotion, or survey.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-38_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-40_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Device Information.</span> We may collect the type of device you use to access our website. It may also include your device identification number, IP address or mobile operating system.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-41_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-43_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Purchase Information.</span> We collect information about your orders and product purchase history.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-44_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-46_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Internet or other Network Activity Information. </span>We may collect information related to your browsing history, search history and other information regarding your interactions with our website or advertisements.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-47_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-49_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Other Information.</span> If you use our website, we may collect information about the browser you are using. We may look at what site you came from, or what site you visit when you leave us.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-50_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-52_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Information provided by public web sites and third parties.</span> For instance, we obtain demographic and other information from companies that can enhance our existing customer information to improve the accuracy and add to the information we have about our customers. This improves our ability to contact you and increases the relevance of our marketing by providing better product recommendations or special offers that may interest you.</span></li></ul><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-53_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-55_">This information is used to provide you with products you request. For example, we use your address information to process, track and deliver purchases you make from our website. We will use your email address to communicate with you about your order and to send you marketing emails. You may correct personal information you have provided to us, including your contact information, by contacting customer service at <a href="mailto:info@hodgesbadge.com" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);">info@hodgesbadge.com</a>. You may also create a customer account with us and can update your information by logging into the account and making the changes to your profile.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-56_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-57_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-58_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-60_"><span style="font-weight: 700;">How We Collect Your Information</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-61_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-63_">We collect information provided directly by our customers, when:</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0px;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-gHjyzD dQAIat pf-64_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-65_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-67_">Making a purchase from our website or catalog</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-68_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-70_">Creating and managing your online account</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-71_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-73_">Responding to catalogs, promotional emails, and notifications of upcoming events</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-74_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-76_">Requesting a catalog</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-77_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-79_">Viewing advertisements that may be of interest to you</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-80_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-82_">Writing product reviews</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-83_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-85_">Interacting with us via social media</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-86_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-88_">Subscribing to Hodges Badge company, Inc. promotional emails</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-89_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-91_">Entering a sweepstakes or contest</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-92_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-94_">Joining our mailing list</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-95_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-97_">Taking a survey</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-98_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-100_">Contacting customer service</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-101_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-103_">Interacting with us via social media platforms</span></li></ul><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-104_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-106_">We use this information to continually improve your experiences, from making our website easier to enhancing our products and customer service.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-107_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-108_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-109_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-111_"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Cookies and Pixel Tags</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-112_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-114_">Certain information about site usage is collected automatically - by cookies, pixel tags, scripts or similar technologies - when you visit our site or open an email that we send. This information may include operating system, device ID, IP address, referring domain, and pages visited. This information is tracked in server logs, and may be used for troubleshooting purposes, or to personalize your experience. Our website also collects aggregate information, such as page views and visits, in an effort to keep our content relevant to our customers.</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-115_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-117_">Information is also collected by cookies, beacons or similar technologies placed by third parties with whom we have contracted. For example, we use Google Analytics to help us understand and improve our website visitor's experience, and we work with vendors to target our advertising to audiences we think will be most interested in our products.</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-118_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-120_">Some cookies are necessary for our website to work properly and enable you to place an item in your online shopping bag and to place an order on our web site. Other cookies allow us to enhance and personalize your online shopping experience. Here are some examples of what cookies allow us to do:</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0px;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-gHjyzD dQAIat pf-121_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-122_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-124_">Remember what items are in your shopping cart</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-125_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-127_">Recognize you when you return to our website</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-128_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-130_">Enable faster checkout if you have created an account at <a href="https://www.hodgesbadge.com" target="_self" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);">www.hodgesbadge.com</a></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-131_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-133_">Understand how you reach our website and which products you are looking for</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-134_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-136_">Learn whether you opened an email from Hodges Badge Company</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-137_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-139_">Deliver personalized marketing from Hodges Badge Company</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-140_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-142_">Apply the preferences you have chosen</span></li></ul><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-143_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-145_">If you set your browser to refuse all cookies, please contact us directly to place your order.</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-146_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-148_">We use pixel tags, a short snippet of code, to tell us how you use our website and help us share the products and content you're most interested in. Pixel tags also enable us to send you email in a format you can read and let us know when you have opened an email message from us.</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-149_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-151_">Some of our third-party vendors may also use cookies or pixel tags on our website to help you enjoy a more personalized experience and to serve advertisements on our behalf. These companies may use a cookie or similar technology to tailor the advertisements you see, to track your response to their advertisement and to measure the effectiveness of their advertising.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-152_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-153_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-154_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-156_"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Sharing Your Information</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-157_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-159_">Some of our services require us to share your information with other companies, who we partner with closely to ensure your privacy stays protected. These services include:</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0px;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-gHjyzD dQAIat pf-160_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-161_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-163_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Service Providers.</span> We may share your information with service providers where necessary to complete a transaction you have requested. For example, when you make a purchase, payment processors and shippers will have access to your payment and shipping information</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-164_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-166_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">IT Service Providers. </span>We share information with Service Providers to operate, understand and improve our website. We may share information (including unique identifiers) with third-party marketing platforms as described below.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-167_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-169_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Marketing Service Providers. </span>To market our products more effectively we contract with Service Providers that provide marketing services including email, search and shopping services, display advertising, direct mail marketing, printing, data and marketing analytics. We use third-party advertising companies to serve advertisements on our behalf. These companies may use a cookie or similar technology to tailor the advertisements you see, to track your response to their advertisement and to measure the effectiveness of their advertising. We may also provide these companies with Personal Information to help them serve more relevant advertisements on our behalf.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-170_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-172_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Where necessary to comply with the law. </span>We may share any information when we believe in good faith that disclosure is necessary in order to protect our rights or to comply with any judicial or administrative proceeding, court or governmental order, or legal process served on us, such as a subpoena. We may also share information when we believe in good faith that such sharing is necessary to prevent fraud or other illegal activity, or to prevent harm.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-173_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-175_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Corporate Asset Transactions.</span> If we may sell, buy, merge or partner with other companies or businesses, or sell some or all our assets, any information we hold may be among the transferred assets and may be shared during due diligence leading up to any transfer.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-176_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-178_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Consent. </span>We may share information about you in any other circumstance in which we have your consent, or to provide you with a service you have requested.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-179_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-180_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-181_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-183_"><b>Your Choices</b></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-184_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-186_">Whenever possible, we are happy to honor changes or preferences you may have regarding your information including:</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0px;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-gHjyzD dQAIat pf-187_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-188_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-190_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Updating Your Information:</span> You can update your name, address, telephone number, or email address through <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="https://hodges-badge.myshopify.com/account/register" target="_self">My Account</a></span> or by <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contacting us</a></span>. To protect your privacy, we will confirm your identity before updating or reviewing your information</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-191_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-193_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Hodges Badge Catalogs: </span>You may change your catalog preferences by <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contacting us</a></span>. Because catalogs are planned in advance, you may still receive mailings while we process your request.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-194_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-196_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Hodges Badge Emails: </span>You may unsubscribe from our promotional emails using the link provided at the bottom of each email, through <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="https://hodges-badge.myshopify.com/account/register" target="_self">My Account</a></span>, or by <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contacting us</a></span>. Because emails are planned in advance, you may still receive mailings while we process your request. To serve you best, you will continue to receive important emails about recent transactions, including orders and returns, even if you choose not to receive promotional emails.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-itWPBs dKPonY pf-197_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-199_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Personalized Advertising:</span> We use third-party advertising companies to serve advertisements on our behalf. These companies may use a cookie or similar technology to tailor the advertisements you see, to track your response to their advertisement and to measure the effectiveness of their advertising. We may also provide these companies with Personal Information to help them serve more relevant advertisements on our behalf. You can learn more about targeted advertising, its benefits and your choices by going to <a href="https://youradchoices.com/control" target="_self" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);">http://www.aboutads.info/consumers/</a>. The targeted advertising companies we work with are members of the Network Advertising Initiative. The NAI allows you to limit targeted advertising from its members by using an opt-out tool available on the NAI website <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org/?c=1" target="_self" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);">Network Advertising Initiative opt-out page.</a></span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-200_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-201_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-202_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-204_"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Links to other Web Sites</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-205_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-207_">Occasionally we link to other websites, including nonprofits that we support. These sites have their own privacy and security policies. If you choose to navigate to another website through our links, we encourage you to review their policies.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-208_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-209_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-210_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-212_"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Information Security</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-213_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-215_">We care greatly about the security of your information and are committed to protecting it against loss, misuse, or unauthorized access. We do this using a variety of the best Information Security technologies and processes. For example, we use encryption or hashing when receiving or transmitting your information. Read more about our <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="/pages/security-practice" target="_self">security practices</a>.</span></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-216_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-217_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-218_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-220_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">European Union Residents</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-221_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-223_">Under European Data Protection Laws (EU GDPR) you have the right to ask us for a copy of any personal data that you have provided to us or that we maintain about you and to request an explanation about the processing. In addition, you have the right to withdraw any consent previously granted or to request correction, amendment, restriction, anonymization or deletion of your personal data; and to obtain the personal data you provide with your consent or in connection with a contract in a structured, machine readable format and to ask us to transfer this data to another data controller.</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-224_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-226_">In certain cases, these rights may be limited, for example if fulfilling your request would reveal personal data about another person or if you ask us to delete information which we are required by law to keep or have compelling legitimate interests to keep.</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-227_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-229_">If you wish to take advantage of any of your rights related to the European Union Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), such as the Right to Erasure (otherwise known as the "Right to be Forgotten"), please <font color="#0047b2"><a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact us</a></font> directly and we will be happy to assist you.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-230_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-231_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-232_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-234_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Nevada Residents</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-235_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-237_">Nevada law gives Nevada consumers the right to request that a company not sell their personal information. This right applies even if their personal information is not currently being sold. If you are a Nevada consumer and wish to exercise this right, please <font color="#0047b2"><a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact us.</a></font></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-238_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-239_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-240_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-242_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">California Residents</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-243_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-245_">The California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018 (the CCPA) provides consumers who are California residents with specific rights regarding their personal information, for more info <span style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);"><a href="/pages/california-privacy-rights" target="_self">click here.</a></span></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-246_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-247_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-248_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-250_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Policy Changes</span></span></h3><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-251_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-253_">Changes to this policy may occur in the future. Changes to our Privacy Policy will be posted to The Hodges Badge Company, Inc. website. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically. Your continued use of the Services indicates your consent to the Privacy Policy as posted.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
